tyle=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33279,32526,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33279, 32526, 9)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tribe Leader</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230831012528&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Muhad_89345c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Muhad.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20Cave\">Nomad Cave</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>His full name is Muhad ib Lisan al-Gaib. He's the leader of the Nomad tribe and not as evil as your average <a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomad</a>.\nMain NPC of the <a href=\"#/quest/nomads-land-quest\">Nomads Land Quest</a> and also part of <a href=\"#/quest/aritos-task-quest\">Arito's Task Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Muhad.</i></dd></dl>\n<p><i>Note: the following transcripts were made after completing the quest in which <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Muhad</strong> is involved.</i><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nMuhad: Welcome back, my friend <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nMuhad: I am the leader of the true sons of Daraman.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nMuhad: My whole name is Muhad ib Lisan al-Gaib. But my people call me simply Muhad.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>darama</b><br/>\nMuhad: This is our home - the land of the desert.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nMuhad: Time is of no importance for us.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ankrahmun</b><br/>\nMuhad: We will fight that city until we get back what belongs to us.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>darashia</b><br/>\nMuhad: We avoid these places you call cities.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>carlin</b><br/>\nMuhad: I would go crazy living in a cage like that.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>thais</b><br/>\nMuhad: I would go crazy living in a cage like that.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king tibianus</b><br/>\nMuhad: Never heard of him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>undead</b><br/>\nMuhad: That is the curse for not following the rules of the desert. No son of the desert has ever come back from the dead.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>pharaoh</b><br/>\nMuhad: We follow our own rules. We don't need the Pharaoh to tell us what to do.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tibia</b><br/>\nMuhad: We have no interest in other regions. Our land is Darama - the desert.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b>/<b>quest</b><br/>\nMuhad: Trying to get the reward twice, huh? I don't blame you for that but I wouldn't be in charge here if I were tricked that easily.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nMuhad: If someone claims to be our king, he should come here and tell us personally.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>news</b><br/>\nMuhad: Well, YOU are the news. The desert had told us about a foreigner who would come.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ferumbras</b><br/>\nMuhad: I am surprised you know about him! There is an old story that is told from generation to generation in order to prepare us for the hardest challenge the true sons have to face. I hope it will never happen.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>excalibug</b><br/>\nMuhad: Is that a weapon? We only use scimitars.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>women</b>/<b>children</b><br/>\nMuhad: You have only seen the surface of our realm. The womenfolk and our children are at a safe place. Don't worry about them.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nMuhad: Please use the back entrance so you don't get in trouble with my people.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Muhad</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["aritos-task-quest","nomads-land-quest"],"pos":{"x":33279,"y":32526,"z":9}}